nner plastic element with two mirrors (sound path) placed in the cylindrical plastic body; two ultrasonic transducers placed on the upside of the cylindrical plastic body. Measurement based on ultrasonic bidirectional transit-time principle.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"calculator_and_indication_device\",\n      \"description\": \"Plastic housing of the calculator with indication device directly mounted on the flow sensor; three PCB boards and one PCB with calculator; electronic LCD display with 2 lines: upper line with 9 digits (indication range 999999.999 m³, sub-multiples indicated by three smaller digits after the decimal point), bottom line with 5 digits to display current flow rate in m³/h; non-replaceable lithium batteries, life 16 years.\",\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"display_volume_line_digits\": {\"value\": 9},\n        \"display_volume_indication_range\": {\"value\": 999999.999, \"unit_symbol\": \"m³\"},\n        \"display_flow_rate_line_digits\": {\"value\": 5},\n        \"battery_chemistry\": {\"value\": \"lithium\"},\n        \"battery_life\": {\"value\": 16, \"unit_symbol\": \"years\"}\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"antenna\",\n      \"description\": \"Non-essential part of the water meter.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"non_return_valve\",\n      \"description\": \"Non-essential part; optional.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"characteristics\": {\n    \"type_level\": {\n      \"accuracy_class\": {\"value\": 2},\n      \"mechanical_class\": {\"value\": \"M1\"},\n      \"climatic_class\": {\"value\": {\"min\": -15, \"max\": 70}, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\"},\n      \"electromagnetic_class\": {\"value\": \"E2\"},\n      \"environmental_classification\": {\"value\": \"B/O\"},\n      \"flow_profile_sensitivity_class\": {\"value\": \"U0D0\"},\n      \"installation_position\": {\"value\": \"Horizontal / Vertical\"},\n      \"ratio_q2_q1\": {\"value\": 1.6},\n      \"max_working_pressure_map\": {\"value\": 16, \"unit_symbol\": \"bar\"},\